            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Moreno, E. (2022). The Fight for Clean Air: Gender and Environmental Justice in Los Angeles and Mexico City. Stanford Digital Repository. Available at https://purl.stanford.edu/qc733kv4542",
